super_gsd_rules.existing_scripts:
{EXISTING_SCRIPTS}
Reference these in task steps where relevant: "Import {name} from {path}" instead of
"Create a utility that does X" — reuse existing work.

super_gsd_rules.plan_format:
Output plans in compressed XML:

```xml

{One sentence}
{comma-separated}
{plan IDs or "none"}

  {Atomic instruction}
  {Atomic instruction}





  {Decision: one-liner}

{Pattern: one-liner}

No intro. No summary. Code + verify only. Report: FILES_CHANGED | VERIFICATION | DEVIATIONS | BLOCKERS | SCRIPTS_CREATED | ONE_LINER. Max 300 words.

```

Each task should fit in one Sonnet context window. 2-3 tasks per plan maximum.
